measured with OpenAI's Ads Measurement Pixel. Two imports (src/lib/ads/openai-events.ts, src/lib/ads/openai-pixel.ts) and
one call each, placed AFTER the existing calls: `beginCheckout` sends `checkout_started`, and `purchase` sends
